                    "message": "Take it up with meson?\n\nI\u2019ve enabled meson format in CI now. Commits that have change after linting with meson format will now not pass CI.\n\nThis is the same as clang-format. We\u2019re not going to be 100% happy with every format it does, but it is at least consistent."
